      "dcterms:title": "HarnessRouter & Unified Harness Protocol (UHP) Engine",
      "dcterms:description": "Unified AI agent execution runtime, session gateway, and routing harness conforming to UHP 2026-08-11 Draft standard. 100% Free and Open Source (Apache-2.0) with local embedded fallback.",
